        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Ryobi ONE+ is the best value cordless platform for homeowners and hobbyists. Its compatibility promise, enormous lineup and frequent promotions make it easy to build a capable kit for a fraction of professional prices. The HP brushless tools are strong enough for most household projects, from decks to remodels.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Skip the standard brushed versions of high-load tools, buy at least one larger battery, and use specialist brands for precision tools and hand tools. If you work in the trades or run tools every day, a professional platform will serve you better over time. For everyone else, Ryobi delivers more tool per dollar than anything else on the shelf.
          </p>
